*.db
news.db
# `*.db` matches only at the top level, so the live database sitting in the
# bind-mount source (`/root/hw-news/data/news.db` on prod — INSIDE the build
# context) was copied into every image: 1.2 MB of stale production data at
# /app/data/news.db, dated whenever the image was last built. Harmless today
# because DB_FILE is the absolute /data/news.db from the mounted volume, but it
# is a loaded gun — anything that ever resolved the DB relatively would read a
# week-old copy and the channel would be reposted from it.
data/
